{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"||\"It's become known to me lately, that there are over a dozen different types that are comprised of elemental properties. I have not discovered all of them, but I'm sure there are more beyond the ones I have encountered.\"||","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:11:31.870000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870111266713243688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"The figure nods. ||I do not have use for such things, but I am aware of them. I was nto aware you all used the term 'essence'.|| The figure seems to ponder this for a moment. ||I am of course well aware of the leylines, they are, i feel, part of me. Or I am part of them? Yes, I am part of them? Or of them? Or intertwined...|| the figure becomes lost in thought once more","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:14:45.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870112076847267860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"|| With someone as innately gifted as you, it is no surprise you speak of it in a different way. I look at such things through my own lens, one that spent too much time learning in dusty libraries and not enough getting in touch with my father's heritage. I have had to deign from others what you seem to naturally *know*. That is truly a gift, Woodsman.||","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:18:13.501000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870112951275749456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"The figure nods abenstmindedly. ||I do not know if i can be said to *naturally* know them, but I take your point. I tend to \"see\" a lot of things differently||","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:20:16.529000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870113467292606514","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"|| My apologies, I do not mean to pontificate into such lofty realms, but do tell me... before I leave you to your practice. What does it take to create such masterpieces? Did you learn from a master as their apprentice? How might I craft a weapon so magnificent? ||","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:23:53.781000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-29T01:24:28.632000Z","id":"870114378513543239","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"The woodsmith chuckles lightly before sighing deeply. They lower their weapon and turn to you. ||I deeply hope that my art dies with me...|| there is a long pause. ||If i even can, that is.|| they return to thinking. ||Besides, these beauties aren't really finished yet. However, when they are, I do hope to make them available at a price for those who protect the great mother and her blood.||","created_at":"2021-07-29T01:37:02.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870117684593971230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
